register lv3
new
new
seal v1 1L
add v1 N2 0.01mol @ 20C
regulate v2 1bar 1L
add v2 N2 0.01mol @ 20C
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v2 volume
inspect
heat v1 10J
heat v2 10J
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v2 volume
inspect
